WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.891 --> 00:00:15.001
Mr. Snippy sliced the air with his blades.

2
00:00:15.002 --> 00:00:20.861
Snip! Snip! He moved closer to Roxy.

3
00:00:20.862 --> 00:00:23.744
Roxy shot her eye laser beams at the blades.

4
00:00:23.745 --> 00:00:28.367
Whiz-hoo! The blades exploded into little pieces.

5
00:00:28.368 --> 00:00:30.884
"Gah!" cried Mr. Snippy.

6
00:00:30.885 --> 00:00:33.963
"I don't care if you have eye laser beams.

7
00:00:33.964 --> 00:00:37.489
You'll never stop me, Rocket Girl!"

8
00:00:37.490 --> 00:00:40.743
Mr. Snippy ran to the back of the salon.

9
00:00:40.744 --> 00:00:44.608
A tiny white poodle stood chained to a table.

10
00:00:44.609 --> 00:00:47.671
"Yip, yip!" The poodle barked.

11
00:00:47.672 --> 00:00:51.562
"Daisy just had a haircut," said Mr. Snippy.

12
00:00:51.563 --> 00:00:56.226
"And now I'll put on her brand-new collar!"

13
00:00:56.227 --> 00:00:59.045
Mr. Snippy put the collar onto Daisy.

14
00:00:59.046 --> 00:01:05.343
Roxy gasped as the little poodle turned into a snarling monster dog!

15
00:01:05.344 --> 00:01:08.979
"I was right, Snippy!" Roxy said angrily.

16
00:01:08.980 --> 00:01:12.629
"Your collars are turning pets into monsters!"

17
00:01:12.630 --> 00:01:14.981
Mr. Snippy had an evil grin.

18
00:01:14.982 --> 00:01:19.065
"My apartment building doesn't allow pets.

19
00:01:19.066 --> 00:01:23.604
So I had to give away my cute little puppy.

20
00:01:23.605 --> 00:01:29.780
Now no one in Metro City will ever have a cute little pet again!"

21
00:01:29.781 --> 00:01:35.990
"Ha-ha-ha!" Mr. Snippy's laugh filled the salon as the poodle leaped at Roxy.

22
00:01:35.991 --> 00:01:38.205
"YIP, YIP!" Daisy barked.

23
00:01:38.206 --> 00:01:41.321
"Ahh!" Roxy jumped out of the way.

24
00:01:41.322 --> 00:01:44.520
The little dog was trying to attack her!

25
00:01:44.521 --> 00:01:47.607
Roxy floated in the air above the barking poodle.

26
00:01:47.608 --> 00:01:50.328
"I need a plan," she thought.

27
00:01:50.329 --> 00:01:53.247
Just then she heard a whirring noise.

28
00:01:53.248 --> 00:01:55.704
It was coming from behind a door.

29
00:01:55.705 --> 00:01:58.815
"YIP, YIP!" Daisy was still barking.

30
00:01:58.816 --> 00:02:02.088
Roxy used her x-ray vision to look through the door.

31
00:02:02.089 --> 00:02:06.563
There was a room with video screens, switches, and blinking lights.

32
00:02:06.564 --> 00:02:11.373
"I'll bet that equipment controls all the collars," thought Roxy.

33
00:02:11.374 --> 00:02:13.907
She made a fist and flew at the door.

34
00:02:13.908 --> 00:02:17.337
Ka-bam! She smashed the door into pieces.

35
00:02:17.338 --> 00:02:23.944
Then—whiz-hoo! She fired her eye laser beams, and the equipment exploded.

36
00:02:23.945 --> 00:02:29.047
"No!" cried Mr. Snippy.

37
00:02:29.048 --> 00:02:34.875
"You destroyed Collar Control Central!"

38
00:02:34.876 --> 00:02:37.288
"Yip, yip!" Daisy barked.

39
00:02:37.289 --> 00:02:39.666
She licked Roxy's face happily.

40
00:02:39.667 --> 00:02:41.843
She was a normal dog again.

41
00:02:41.844 --> 00:02:45.267
Roxy waited for Daisy's owner to come.

42
00:02:45.268 --> 00:02:49.103
Then she took Mr. Snippy to jail.

43
00:02:49.104 --> 00:02:51.495
Roxy returned to Metro City Park.

44
00:02:51.496 --> 00:02:53.645
She saw the man with one shoe.

45
00:02:53.646 --> 00:02:55.490
He was walking Buster.

46
00:02:55.491 --> 00:03:01.140
"I'm glad you're a normal dog again, Buster," said the man.

47
00:03:01.141 --> 00:03:03.421
Roxy soon found her friends.

48
00:03:03.422 --> 00:03:05.933
Max was still sleeping.

49
00:03:05.934 --> 00:03:08.707
"Guess what!" said Terrell.

50
00:03:08.708 --> 00:03:12.264
"Rocket Girl saved us from monster pets!"

51
00:03:12.265 --> 00:03:16.817
Mara nodded. "The pets were awful!"

52
00:03:16.818 --> 00:03:19.192
She looked down at Max and hugged him.

53
00:03:19.193 --> 00:03:22.625
"Not like boring Max!"

54
00:03:22.626 --> 00:03:27.755
Roxy laughed. "Good dog, Max!"
